{"2876150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alien Strike: Blasting the Intruders", "steam_appid": 2876150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/1623d6f9fc14e65bb040261fc80ca14a.avif?t=1778159624\" width=616 height=121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Alien Strike is a <strong>Run 'n Gun</strong> with retro energy! <strong>Slide, jump and shoot in 8 directions</strong> as you face an alien invasion in electrifying levels with pixelated visuals and lots of action. With <strong>local multiplayer for up to 3 players,</strong> take <strong>control of recruits, collect, upgrade and share weapons in real time</strong>, acquire energy for powerful special moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2990d43f4873459e2f413d4003efb10c.webp?t=1778159624\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2990d43f4873459e2f413d4003efb10c.poster.webp?t=1778159624\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/7423115315d1f2f575d71efb9e990532.avif?t=1778159624\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Equip two weapons and switch between them in the heat of combat. Collect the same weapon more than once to unleash its X version - turbocharged, with more aggressive shots, different shapes and increased firepower. Choose well, combine styles and turn the tables in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2b60646827f47612d6e57d63728bb940.webp?t=1778159624\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2b60646827f47612d6e57d63728bb940.poster.avif?t=1778159624\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/9c47bdd2396b1c3209b8ab80abbca114.avif?t=1778159624\" width=616 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each defeated enemy fuels your special bar - and when it bursts, get ready for an explosion! Activate a devastating blow that clears the screen and commands respect. It's the kind of move that shines like a flashing neon in the chaos of the battlefield. The timing makes all the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2dec23a8d10adfcf8a95451997a4e4f5.webp?t=1778159624\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2dec23a8d10adfcf8a95451997a4e4f5.poster.webp?t=1778159624\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/f53f25eec4a3eb5ba2f2fa44b5864cf4.avif?t=1778159624\" width=616 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your team and engage in side-by-side combat in local co-op mode for up to 3 players. At full arcade pace, each player can run, climb cables, dominate the map and distribute lead in real time. Play with friends like old times - synchronization, chaos and camaraderie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/4e4630eb4a70d6ec549cb73ecaad094d.avif?t=1778159624\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on monsters in epic fights reminiscent of the golden age of arcades. Each boss brings unique attacks, unexpected patterns and a trail of destruction all around you. Survive the firefight and face the final battle like a true hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/1623d6f9fc14e65bb040261fc80ca14a.avif?t=1778159624\" width=616 height=121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Alien Strike is a <strong>Run 'n Gun</strong> with retro energy! <strong>Slide, jump and shoot in 8 directions</strong> as you face an alien invasion in electrifying levels with pixelated visuals and lots of action. With <strong>local multiplayer for up to 3 players,</strong> take <strong>control of recruits, collect, upgrade and share weapons in real time</strong>, acquire energy for powerful special moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2990d43f4873459e2f413d4003efb10c.webp?t=1778159624\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2990d43f4873459e2f413d4003efb10c.poster.webp?t=1778159624\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/7423115315d1f2f575d71efb9e990532.avif?t=1778159624\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Equip two weapons and switch between them in the heat of combat. Collect the same weapon more than once to unleash its X version - turbocharged, with more aggressive shots, different shapes and increased firepower. Choose well, combine styles and turn the tables in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2b60646827f47612d6e57d63728bb940.webp?t=1778159624\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2b60646827f47612d6e57d63728bb940.poster.avif?t=1778159624\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/9c47bdd2396b1c3209b8ab80abbca114.avif?t=1778159624\" width=616 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each defeated enemy fuels your special bar - and when it bursts, get ready for an explosion! Activate a devastating blow that clears the screen and commands respect. It's the kind of move that shines like a flashing neon in the chaos of the battlefield. The timing makes all the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2dec23a8d10adfcf8a95451997a4e4f5.webp?t=1778159624\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/2dec23a8d10adfcf8a95451997a4e4f5.poster.webp?t=1778159624\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=246 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/f53f25eec4a3eb5ba2f2fa44b5864cf4.avif?t=1778159624\" width=616 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your team and engage in side-by-side combat in local co-op mode for up to 3 players. At full arcade pace, each player can run, climb cables, dominate the map and distribute lead in real time. Play with friends like old times - synchronization, chaos and camaraderie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/extras/4e4630eb4a70d6ec549cb73ecaad094d.avif?t=1778159624\" width=616 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on monsters in epic fights reminiscent of the golden age of arcades. Each boss brings unique attacks, unexpected patterns and a trail of destruction all around you. Survive the firefight and face the final battle like a true hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Slide, jump and shoot in 8 directions in this explosive Run 'n Gun for up to 3 players! Swap weapons in real time, activate insane specials and take on alien bosses in an action-packed invasion of retro mayhem!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, German, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/96dcdfa9230a6e9d94949319670575cbfadab13b/header.jpg?t=1778159624", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/52a82f0b9bfca6ec8c0f521237d93814ecb8baf1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778159624", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876150/52a82f0b9bfca6ec8c0f521237d93814ecb8baf1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778159624", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong